---
export const title = 'Keyboard and events';
export const order = 400;
---

<p>The day grid follows the WAI-ARIA date picker pattern. Only one day is a tab stop.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Key</th><th>Moves to</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Left / Right</td><td>Previous / next day</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Up / Down</td><td>Same day of the previous / next week</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Home / End</td><td>First / last day of the week</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Page Up / Page Down</td><td>Same day of the previous / next month</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Shift + Page Up / Page Down</td><td>Same day of the previous / next year</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Enter / Space</td><td>Picks the focused day</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>
  Events carry the value in <code>event.detail.value</code>: <code>change</code> when a date (or the
  end of a range) is picked or the value is cleared, and <code>input</code> when the start of a range
  is picked.
</p>
